  "title": "Peach Berry Cobbler",
  "description": "This peach berry cobbler recipe combines the fresh taste of peaches with sweet blueberries for a warm dessert with a sugar-and-spice biscuit topping.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy Posont"
  ],
